  <title type="title-main" format="text/plain" language="en" script="Latn">Optical transport network: Protocol-neutral management information model for the network element view</title>
  <title type="main" format="text/plain" language="en" script="Latn">Optical transport network: Protocol-neutral management information model for the network element view</title>
